{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_09",
  "title": "向过去告别",
  "storyCode": "AS-9",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1ffaabe0c6676cb5f7d7b8b545d0fdbde9f18dda77459932f457079f84387ebb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欢迎来到这里，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这便是沙阿所留下的宝库吗？和博物馆好像......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的感知是正确的，在我记忆还未恢复的时候，就觉得城中有些地方似曾相识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在建立城市的过程中，我想他们兴许是参考了陵寝的修建风格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这里到底有什么，祖拜尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "墙壁上的油灯燃起，光线在如镜面般光滑的墙体与支柱间游走，昏暗的大厅变得明亮。\n一时之间，无数犹如鬼魂一般的虚影，齐齐出现在大厅之中，或行或立。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来在沙阿的宝库中藏着的宝物......都是他自己啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来他这么自恋的吗......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然不是，这些影像都是姐姐让我保存在这里的，自父亲离去后，姐姐一直很想念他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "千年前，史官们通过发掘到的古代科技，保存了父亲的一言一行，无不栩栩如生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在阿尔萨兰地区也找到了类似的物品，在晶洞中，它为我展示了一段沙阿的影像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那正是我留下的，我以为会有梦魇后裔找到那段影像，然后顺着线索找过来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你把它藏得太隐秘了，祖拜尔，别人肯定找不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "隐秘？我可是在外面主持修建了一座巨大的神庙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看来它没能抵御岁月的侵蚀，在我到达的时候，那里已经是一片颓唐破败的废墟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但它还是指引你来到了这里，并且将我唤醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这正是岁月变迁的奇妙之处，一些当时看来派不上用场的安排，也会因为一系列阴差阳错，作用出美妙的巧合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来这里还有沙阿摘下面具的样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这样的影像我不仅仅在阿尔萨兰见过，小时候，我和弟弟捉迷藏，误入了一间存放棺椁与亡者的密室。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "虽然有家学教导，知道自己迟早要接触到这些，但让一个孩子独自面对这些还是过于勉强了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当时我慌张失措，不知是误触了什么机关，见到了一段沙阿的影像，但我对他毫无认知，只当他是一个试图与自己沟通的鬼魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "他告诉我，这些棺椁只是一段被掩埋在沙土中的历史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当后来人将它发掘后，会架起一座跨越时间的桥梁，让我们跨过漫漫历史长河，彼此相识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我记得这句话......当时母亲去世，姐姐靠在棺椁上流泪不止，这是父亲蹲下来安慰她的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还记得，姐姐成为史官后，父亲常叮嘱她的话，要关注......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要关注那些让英雄成为英雄的——历史的背面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......原来你已经听过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这是那段影像最后留下的话，我一直记着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看着路加萨尔古斯的影像，佩佩突然觉得有些荒诞。\n一路的追寻中，她曾无数次地想象过沙阿的宝库中究竟保存着什么。\n但此刻她突然意识到，自己所谓的执着与追寻，不过是从一个虚影到另一个虚影。\n她抓紧手中的重锤，竭力忍住想要挥动它驱散眼前影子的冲动。\n更让她觉得恐惧的是，自己家族所谓的职责与传承，又何尝不是一道虚影呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梅捷缇克缇女士，我按照黄页把其他员工都联系了一遍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有不怕死愿意过来帮忙的人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不确定，大多数人回答得都很复杂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......谢谢你，你能再给阿娜特女士找几瓶水来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿雅妮",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好的，梅捷缇克缇女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......像吉雅阿和妮雅阿一样不知道怕的人，终究还是少数。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿娜特，我们现在也许只有两个小时。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实现在立刻向城外逃跑，才是最好的办法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，缇缇，我在比对城市测绘记录，无法分心想那么多......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你应该知道，我和你留在这里的原因一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是那两个游客呢？她们和祖拜尔的复活没有任何关系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们甚至和这座城市也没有什么关系......现在我们却让她们进入地下水道，去做最危险的探查工作，想办法堵住灌进来的沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以我只能尽我最大的努力，让她们的勇气不会被浪费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我帮你捏捏耳朵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谢谢你，缇缇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，你看，这一段施工日志提到了异常地质结构。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——好，我立刻记录下来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "缇缇，你说，我关于祖拜尔先生的研究最终也没发表，我们死前对城市地下结构的摸索也没机会让人知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我没能留下自己的“名”，就这么死掉，父亲岂不是会很失望？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就都怪佩佩，都是我们尊敬的帕夏之女太有本事导致的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——拉恕尔先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，博物馆现在处于紧急情况，没有时间接待您，尊敬的监管人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请不要用敬语，我已经不是监管人了。我只是一个重获自由民身份的，被赦免的工匠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可现在博物馆无法保证任何人的安全，我们能给出的最诚挚的建议，就是用一切手段尽快离开城市中心......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......交出现有的一切之后，我陪伴着祖拜尔先生在缓缓流下的黄沙前站了一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您见到了祖拜尔先生？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看着他试图用法术修补一尊又一尊陶瓷雕塑，但最后停下来，对我说，“我们的职责如此”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我明白，职责便是你我坚持到最后，绝不问为什么的东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "即使结果并不如人愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "请问，为了让这座城市不被毁灭，我能做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看好了，这次该我展示首领的指挥能力了。很快你就会相信，自己应该听我的安排，留在博物馆里保护其他人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从这里往左转，我们又会绕回刚才走过的那条路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我在地下水道里转了这么多天，怎么没遇到过这么鬼打墙的事情？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先说好，我以往率领手下行动的时候可从不迷路，这不是我的能力问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也不认为这是你的能力问题。或许让人迷路正是这些曲折甬道本来的作用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博物馆的正副两位馆长翻找历年测绘资料的时候，我听到了几句讨论内容。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们似乎认为，我们所处的旧地下水道只是这座城市地下结构的一小部分。也许通过历史资料，她们能推测出通往更深层的道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们最近一直在协助一位考古学家寻找线索，而那些线索指向的很可能是古籍中被称为“宝库”的建筑遗址。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果这座城市深处真的藏着另一幢宏大建筑的遗址......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有宝库？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......没什么，当我没说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你似乎并不害怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "害怕什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们的任务不就是找到漏沙子的区域，关闭那一段的闸门？如果闸门坏了，就用我们扛着的材料直接堵上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但我们很有可能找不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，那......是有点可惜。要是我们失败了，城市就会被埋进沙子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过我们在地下，我们会最先看到沙子漫上来，也许还来得及用通讯提醒博物馆里的人赶快跑，只不过我们自己就跑不掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......等等。你是因为这个才坚持要来地下水道的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为这个任务有生命危险，这种时候你必须站在最前面？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "娜仁图亚，阿斯帕齐娅，听得到吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......听得到，我们在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们有了一些头绪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你们注意一下周围的声音，应该能找到拉恕尔的发条羽兽......一些蓝色的，羽兽外形的机械。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们推测出了一些可能存在深层结构的位置，如果你们能帮发条羽兽在墙壁上打开缝隙，这些羽兽可以飞过去收集信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "掌握足够的信息之后，我们应该能找到黄沙涌入的确切位置，但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿娜特",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "发条羽兽并不能承担关闭机关、填堵裂隙一类的工作......抱歉，你们可能要亲自涉险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我想你一定在我向你展示的记忆中留意到了，你的额饰，和我姐姐头上的一模一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这枚额饰我们家族代代相传。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我以前也曾疑惑过，为何我的家族世代坚守着为万王之王记叙作传的职责，问父亲，父亲也不知道从何而起，只说是天职如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "原来答案竟是这样简单，不过是源自一个孩子对父亲的思念。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐一直坚信，父亲终究有天会回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但很可惜，直到离世，她都没有等到，而我，也没来得及去见她最后一面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐死后，只有父亲的虚影陪同我继续走下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，放下去黄金之城的执念吧，我知道如何将意识封存进宝石，亦知晓如何打造不朽的身躯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你会有永恒的生命去经历，去发现，去记述......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "很抱歉......祖拜尔......我并不能代替你的姐姐陪伴你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我也有弟弟，他在黄金之城担任史官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "真是遗憾，那可不是什么好职位，他们知道太多不能呈现在纸面上的东西了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我那愚蠢的王兄为了让史官按照他的心意记述历史，强行要求姐姐将自己的双胞胎儿子之一送进王宫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想不到千年后，这样的胁迫变成了荣光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那位兽主说，所有史官都会被割去舌头，这是真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不清楚现任万王之王如何行事，但这确实是行之有效的保密方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......无论如何，我都要去黄金之城找他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那就离开吧，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不......我还不能离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这座城市，我不能弃之不顾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不能放任构装体继续在城里作乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放过这里吧，就像你说的，那些最为珍贵的宝物还没有被玷污。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，佩佩，即使我想要停下来，也无法停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "人的一生会经历大大小小的抉择，它们相互嵌套着，在无穷的分支路径中为每个人刻画出独一无二的回路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我对父亲的誓言，对姐姐的誓言，已经被刻成回路，永远留在这些宝石之上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我绝不可能违背它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有一丝可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那祖拜尔，告诉我，我该如何停下构装体呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经告诉你答案了，佩佩，接下来，要靠你自己的努力了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "像当时那些前来进犯的军队一样，尽全力抓住我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "其实那天和阿雅吉阿雅妮聊过之后，我一直觉得有些事情应该告诉你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这石头可真难敲，但愿我们的时间还够......她们说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蓝色的发条羽兽在二人头顶盘旋着，催促她们凿开眼前的石砖。\n阿斯帕齐娅很庆幸一切如此顺利，在踏入那条可能的通路之前，自己只剩下一件事情要做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我得知了你渴望财富的缘由。你觉得自己欠了过去的手下一笔债。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哦。从哪里讲起的？我们仓皇逃命的那个晚上，还是所有财宝都被我给出去的时候？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "从你离开之后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从阿雅吉和阿雅妮那里听了很多故事。她们去伐木场干活总是用蛮力弄坏锯条，帮人看店把账本记得一团糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "趁你不在，有人提刀杀了自己的最后一只驮兽，卖刀换了锅具，宴请众人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......然后他的厨艺名扬全镇，在集市里开了家小吃店，每天顾客络绎不绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有人把当沙盗的经历写成了故事，在小报上连载，广受好评，据说现在已经编到你们穿越千年时间，去抢沙阿的王座。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大多数人有间房屋，不会随季节迁徙，来得及在雨季前补好屋顶，让它不漏雨。你的那些手下，如今依然过得不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......这我当然知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我尊敬你，但我认为你不欠他们什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像你也没有必要救一座城，只为了救两个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你应该逃出去，然后回去看看......再然后，放下你的担子，你的“职责”，往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "巨石缓缓滑动的隆隆声打断了阿斯帕齐娅。\n二人合力凿石的动作仿佛触动了古老迷宫的关窍，那块有着斑驳浮雕的石砖猛地退入河道的墙体内。几秒钟后，她们听见石头的坠落声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接着，整片墙体开始崩塌，但正如阿娜特所言，墙外并不是黄沙。\n一片空荡荡的黑暗昭示着她们正面对着某种庞大建筑的内部。\n她们眼前也并没有路。流沙声无比清晰地从深处传来，仿佛深渊之下是丰水期奔腾的河流。\n一条踏入便有去无回的河流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在那一瞬间，她们默契地同时扔下手中的铁镐，拔出了武器。\n沙尘扬起，二人拉出不到十步的距离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要干嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阻止你跳下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对吧，刚刚不是我在拦着你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我之前就想说了，你要是冲着送死来的，我可不能放任你往前走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我还以为你比那两个家伙靠谱，没想到你也是个需要我搭救的手下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我说过了，你不必承担这样的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你误会我了。我只是想自己去看看，并且相信自己比任何人都适合去做这件事，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就像，即使不是为了让手下重新过上好日子，我还是会想要堆成山的金子。没办法，我就是这么贪心嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“人的一生会经历大大小小的抉择。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你管这个叫职责，但我比较喜欢说，这是我自己选的。这就是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好啦，既然你是个训练有素的格斗家，不会往刀口上撞，那现在我要动真格了，你可别生气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我对你只有真心的感谢，娜仁图亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现在，我不必畏惧与你展开一场真正的对决。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我曾经不敢相信我的内心，因为我跟随家族立下的誓言......关乎鲜血与暴力，视战争为最公正的践踏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但如今我已见过坚定之人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "或许萨尔贡人的信念也有其可取之处。我由我做出的抉择构成，因此从今往后——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——哎！你怎么不等我说完——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她的视野突然变得一片黑暗。\n展开的黑色刀扇自眼前掠过，闭眼又睁眼的一瞬间，地下水道中仅有的灯光被彻底吞没。\n她的确记得娜仁图亚还有两把黑色的刀，带有机关，无法直接从鞘中抽出。\n但那一瞬间她只是想起，历史中有一支神民库兰塔被称为梦魇，因为他们曾不分日夜行军，在正午时吞噬太阳。\n她凭借记忆冲向对方所在的位置——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——然后落了个空。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一点利用沙子的障眼法，一点源石技艺制造的幻觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "谁说只有打出输赢这一种做法的？抢先跳下去不就行了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在黑夜与幻象的簇拥之中，娜仁图亚后退了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "等等，娜仁图亚！这不是公正的对决！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看，你又拿了一枚银牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祖拜尔，你是认真的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你一边指引我攻击你，一边又蹿得飞快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还是一早放弃得好，佩佩，我告诉过你了，如何尝试都只会是无用功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算你再用力挥舞那柄重锤，也碰不到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哼，瞧不起谁呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉......你是打算靠砸断这间大厅的支撑点来缩小我活动的范围吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那可不是什么好方法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "说话间，流沙涌过，那些断裂的石柱与破碎的地面便恢复如初。\n佩佩穿过一个又一个虚影，寻找着祖拜尔的身影。\n但往往余光才捕捉到他的袍角，下一秒他便藏身于众多虚影之后，再难寻觅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你还需要再专心些，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你知道吗，祖拜尔？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我十四岁之前，医生曾经判断我是个孱弱的孩子，像这样的重锤，终身都无法举起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可你现在看着瘦小，但已能将它挥舞生风了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没错，为了能够深入沙漠与雨林，寻找那些失落的古迹进行考古，我拜托萨尔贡著名的力士对我进行训练。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "到十七岁时，我便可独自穿越广阔的沙漠，一力对抗数十个沙匪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "佩佩，光靠这些是不够的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，我并非想为你展现自己的能力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是想告诉你，从小到大，只要我决心去做，就没有做不成的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那些目标再难，再苦......只要我想要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我就一定会达到！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，佩佩，你之所以会有这样的错觉，不过是因为你才活了二十二年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当年，我在父亲麾下效力，无数拥上来的敌人都被我斩于剑下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听到他们的哀鸣令我何其自信，以为假以时日，世间没有得不到的东西，没有做不到的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "殊不知，我这一生最大的敌人，正是漫漫时光！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "金影掠过，还来不及转头，佩佩便感受到自己的脚踝处传来剧痛。\n那根手杖远比想象中还要沉重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你得快些了，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "杀死每一个侵犯父亲陵寝的人，是写在我的宝石回路上的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的不停攻击，已经让它感觉到恼怒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它开始催促我，早些结束这一切了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你不该和我玩这个游戏的，祖拜尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这场战斗并非游戏，佩佩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，它是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祖拜尔",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，竟然闭上了眼睛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前漆黑一片，佩佩知道，自己的眼睛不够敏锐，只会是拖累。\n小的时候，在花园中玩捉迷藏，无论如何努力，自己都抓不到身手敏捷的弟弟，那小子简直滑得像一条鳞。\n直到某天，她偶然闭上眼睛，发现弟弟踏在石板上的脚步声竟是如此清晰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那小子就在我身后......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只要我回身得够快......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我就能抓到他！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "闭紧双眼，佩佩使尽全力将重锤向身前挥去，不出意料，她听到了响亮的碎裂声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
